{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05391","headline":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边 · 胡皓","name":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕公爲汉将，武德奉文思。\n利用经戎莽，英图叶圣诒。\n塞沙制长策，穷石卷摇旗。\n万里要相贺，三边又在兹。\n棱威方逐逐，谈笑坐怡怡。\n宠饯纷郊道，充厨竭御司。\n尝醪企行迈，听乐罢涟洏。\n衮旒垂翰墨，缨蕤迭赋诗。\n金山无积阻，玉树有华滋。\n请迨炎风暮，归旌候此时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}